>>
>> Trying to execute the Linux kernel in less than 500 ms, this is quite =
a
>> hold-up, and therefore request the probe from an async task.
>>
>> With this change, the test shows, that the function returns earlier.
>>
>> ```
>> [    3.254800] calling  azx_driver_init+0x0/0xfe4 [snd_hda_intel] @ 22=
